刘贤志在境外落网并被遣返回国。\n\n刘贤志，男，1977年2月生，北京志骏腾达建筑工程有限公司实际控制人，涉嫌向多名公职人员行贿，于2026年5月外逃。陕西省监察机关依法对刘立案调查，扎实开展追逃追赃工作，积极开展国际执法合作，于近日将其缉拿归案。\n\n中央追逃办负责人表示，刘贤志归案是纪检监察机关贯彻党的二十届五中全会精神，落实反跨境腐败法，深入开展追逃追赃工作的最新成果。我们将持续深化反腐败执法司法合作，有效预防和惩治跨境腐败行为，坚持受贿行贿一起查、一起追，坚决追回外逃涉腐人员和境外涉腐资产，决不让境外成为法外。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/YNV3511a0IMJ62yd79eOLjnLRPqavaB2moM7yAn2xnKutfVv-3_h3wXAl29kdSMswUYFsSVZpeH6TJ6-hl4txi0556tvaqiIdRh9CF67H4nzU-F3k2vhWOlPKeFwph0m5FRmszIwlUd8wRN39nMod1s505lM0EYTKz9Mt5fMk0Q-N9ErrdyutqivBMltONNN-HvjsQ2lFkFSDCbQn_Daow0lUPinWkK8NeIWWhMia98XdrVuna_xT2l1UvE6FNCKh3ZYo_OKsLEX4OHuzHP5nhzhCjPhsqHbAWnVkSEtkj6izouY9MV_8CfQ9iYJ6HsN2-JMHfTSoau9KgC0-fHaVw.jpg"}],"views":1020,"views_label":"1.02K","reactions":[{"emoji":"👏","count":5,"label":"5"},{"emoji":"🥱","count":1,"label":"1"},{"emoji":"🖕","count":1,"label":"1"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-23T05:06:44+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113512","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"特朗普又开始回味在中国受到热情欢迎","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113512","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113512_1.webp","width":800,"height":639},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:19:31+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T05:09:45+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"特朗普又开始回味在中国受到热情欢迎","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/KRc77vj-s_pi42wHvLtinlLrysQbEazgkNls7z8NkljOXOm-PXqugKCGfy1lPan3OmBbPBIduo3d0tC4LUtUs05oAv5JF3rweBQ7XXrknrQQsv2WmkAJFoXT1IJCXlbLoC3S8U-m_k0lG8QbqBj65GBfi1HTxmi8ilnpOwntaOOb1bbEqIv68g4SQPyc6HmuVHVbH4V1czLXhBUkMpDzryIIbDEp2cOL1TZYc69wsKh_Hk-Sex7zQS9IpFJRZsdt8rFoCMrU996rv15UZWPtx_WISHkvu5jk43x3C628ySXemC0oaUzuBWTYhWnRCsqAVisLxkrMx8iDFDHTA8bl1A.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/gRJQBjlQ-Q-Gip2PYOV_JmZHhGh9aRS4eC65WZwaWV09joLz1AaZpEss_vrrqCl4NbjfHsbjcrY4ip0sOuPawmOTJ5U9fUznRieiHsUbdwj6Spifrcu2I8jB7jLbqGoJqOE0nu2XerJFOxsYUOxwSYPj1YBE4NbczqvnJjogEDvu-Ms_du4dXOD_-RnZV9Q9kc13gZ7J_pJqFPsUFZDGVJDmakLG7Fwdj3LTAC2KwZMgAj4f